        "worked_solution": "For any two finite sets $X$ and $Z,$ the cardinality of $X\\times Z$ is\n\n$$\n|X\\times Z|=|X|\\cdot |Z|.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|X\\times Z| & =|X|\\cdot |Z| \\\\  & =10\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =60.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
